OL,4,CJury out in train stabbing attempted   
OL,5,Cmurder trial                           
OL,6,GJurors have been sent out to begin     
OL,7,Gconsidering their verdicts in the      
OL,8,Gtrial of a knifeman accused of         
OL,9,Gattempting to murder 10 people on a    
OL,10,GLondon-bound train.                    
OL,12,FAnthony Williams, 33, stabbed 10       
OL,13,Fpassengers between Peterborough and    
OL,14,FHuntingdon, Cambridgeshire, on 1       
OL,15,FNovember 2025.                         
OL,17,FHe has also pleaded not guilty to the  
OL,18,Fattempted murders of three people in   
OL,19,FPeterborough and a boy in London prior 
OL,20,Fto the stabbings.                      
